    <string name="dev_link_away">TV henteu ngawaler. Aplikasi nyobian deui nyalira salami rémot dibuka.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Henteu ngawaler</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">Mintonkeun input sareng sadaya aplikasi TV, ngagentos input dina TV nu teu ngaréspon tombol HDMI, sareng ngatur kacaangan dina sababaraha TV. Jalanna ngalangkungan sambungan debugging (ADB) TV. Tombol sareng ngetik tetep jalan sami tanpa éta.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Sambungkeun</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV nolak sambunganana. Pariksa yén USB debugging hurung. Ti saprak Android TV 14 sababaraha TV ngan nampi Wireless debugging, nu teu acan tiasa dianggo ku TennaRC.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging pareum di TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">TV hilap kana telepon ieu, sapertos Android TV ka alat nu teu katingali saminggu. Cobian deui, teras idinan di TV.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten_short">TV hilap kana telepon ieu</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed">Teu aya nu ngidinan di TV. Cobian deui, teras pilih OK di dinya.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed_short">Teu diidinan di TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_off">Pareum. Nambihan input sareng sadaya aplikasi</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Toél Sambungkeun, teras dina TV contréng Always allow sareng pilih OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Buka Developer options, gigireun About, teras hurungkeun USB debugging. Dina Shield, éta téh Network debugging.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Dina TV, buka Settings › System › About teras pilih Android TV OS build tujuh kali. Dina TV nu langkung lami, éta téh Device Preferences › About › Build.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_title">Sambungan pamekar</string>
    <string name="dev_link_turn_off">Pareuman</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Ngan Wireless debugging nu hurung, nu teu acan tiasa dianggo ku TennaRC. Hurungkeun ogé USB debugging, atanapi pasangkeun sakali ti komputer teras jalankeun adb tcpip 5555, nu lumaku dugi ka TV hurung deui.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless_short">Ngan Wireless debugging nu hurung</string>
